                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No. 780.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Phelan to Mr. Rives.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Halifax</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
